                {
                  "no": 20,
                  "type": "SUPPLIER",
                  "note": "A daily resort of $40.00 plus tax per suite per night applies and $40.00 plus tax for a 3 bedroom suite.\n\nResort fee capped to a maximum charge of 5 nights. \n\nThe fee includes the following; Access to the Surfari Water Park which features a dual rider surf simulator, an interactive water structure with multiple slides, more than 725 feet (221 meters) of lazy river, and nearby lounge chairs and umbrellas, transportation to the Walt Disney World\u00AE Resort Disney Transportation Center (DTC), resort-wide wireless internet, use of business center, local and toll-free telephone, use of fitness center, and in-room coffee and tea set up. ",
                  "systemGenerated": true,
                  "noteId": 0
