                },
                {
                  "no": 7,
                  "type": "BOOKING",
                  "note": "Excited \u0026 looking forward to your upcoming holiday and stay at The Grove Resort \u0026 Water Park Orlando!\n\nWe wanted to let you know about some useful information before you depart. As you will be aware the apartments at the resort are self-catering, so whilst you have the convenience of a resort with its wide range of amenities, there are some subtle differences compared to a hotel.\n\nHousekeeping Information \n\u2022 Full Cleaning: Apartments will receive a full clean on the 5th day for stays of 8 nights or more. \n\u2022 Rubbish Removal: For stays of 4 nights or more, rubbish will be removed every other day. \n\u2022 Assistance: If you need anything, please visit the front desk.\n\nPool Towels \n\u2022 Upon check-in, you will receive the appropriate number of pool towels for your party size. These are yours to use throughout your stay. \n\u2022 Each apartment has a washer and dryer for freshening up the towels if needed.\n\nOccasionally if the weather gets chilly the Water Park will close if temperatures are 55F degrees or below.\n\nAdditionally, for your convenience and benefit before you travel and whilst on holiday, The Grove Resort \u0026 Water Park have their very own app where you can check-In, book hotel services, communicate directly with hotel staff, browse hotel information and much more. Please note this app is not affiliated with Virgin Atlantic Holidays, this is for your information.\n",
                  "systemGenerated": true,
                  "noteId": 0
                },
