        },
        {
          "no": 6,
          "code": "The Grove Resort \u0026 Water Park Orlando - Resort fee",
          "description": "The Grove Resort \u0026 Water Park Orlando - Resort fee",
          "note": "Please note The Grove Resort \u0026 Water Park have a Daily resort fee of $40 plus \ntax per suite,per night. The resort fee is capped to a maximum charge of 5 nights. \n\nThis is payable locally \u0026 subject to change at any time. \n\u00A0",
