        {
          "no": 17,
          "code": "Offsite Disney Magic Ticket",
          "description": "Offsite Disney Magic Ticket",
          "note": "Disney Magic Tickets can be purchased for 7- or 14-day Walt Disney World Park\n admission. \n\n14 Day Disney Magic Ticket is valid for 14 days admission across an 18-day \nwindow from the selected start date of the ticket.\n\n7 Day Disney Magic Ticket is valid for 7 days admission across a 15-day window\n from the selected start date of the ticket.\n\nFor the 7 or 14- Day Disney Magic Ticket selected please make sure you\n choose the date of your first park visit as the start date of your ticket.",
